      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>This is a transcription of the prayer for travelers on sea voyages, from <tei:hi rend="italic">Siddur Siftei Tsadiqim (The Form of Prayers) vol. 1: Seder haTefilot miKol haShanah</tei:hi> (1837), compiled by Isaac Leeser , p. 198-199. I made some small changes to the English translation to more closely match it to the Hebrew source in this linear format, and removed most but not all archaisms. –Aharon Varady</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
